.el .ds Aq '
.TH hs-meetings 1 2026-09-09 "sandogasa 0.23.1" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
hs\-meetings \- Chair CentOS Hyperscale SIG meetings: day\-of script, meetbot archive list and sync
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhs\-meetings\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Chair CentOS Hyperscale SIG meetings: day\-of script, meetbot archive list and sync
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS hs-meetings list
\fBhs\-meetings list\fR [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-period\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
List SIG meetings recorded on meetbot
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR [default: centos\-hyperscale\-sig]
Meetbot search topic (matches meeting topic substrings)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR
Start date filter (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<UNTIL>\fR
End date filter (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD, default: today)
.TP
\fB\-\-period\fR \fI<PERIOD>\fR
Calendar period filter — e.g. `2026`, `2026Q1`, `2026H1`
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit JSON instead of the human\-readable table
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS hs-meetings script
\fBhs\-meetings script\fR [\fB\-\-date\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Print the day\-of zodbot script for chairing a SIG meeting
.TP
\fB\-\-date\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
Meeting date (YYYY\-MM\-DD, default: the coming Wednesday)
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR [default: centos\-hyperscale\-sig]
Meetbot topic the previous meeting was recorded under
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit JSON (the script plus what it was built from)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS hs-meetings sync
\fBhs\-meetings sync\fR [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-period\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-file\fR> 
.PP
Sync SIG meetings into a tool\-managed markdown list file
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to the tool\-managed meetings list file
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<TOPIC>\fR [default: centos\-hyperscale\-sig]
Meetbot search topic
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR
Start date filter (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<UNTIL>\fR
End date filter (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD, default: today)
.TP
\fB\-\-period\fR \fI<PERIOD>\fR
Calendar period filter — e.g. `2026`, `2026Q1`, `2026H1`
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print planned changes without writing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
